# What `vercel deploy` must never upload (docs/deploy-vercel.md). The CLI uploads local files, including git-ignored
# ones, so every secret, raw API body and private table is listed here. The one git-ignored file a deploy does ship
# is deploy/vercel/plans.json: the recorded sheets that recorded mode serves.

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Raw Qloo response bodies, probe output, private tables, caches and local stores
fixtures/raw
**/fixtures/raw
probe_out
**/probe_out
data/private
evals/out/private
.cache
**/.cache
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*

# Static mirror pages (copies of sheets; the mirror is its own host)
deploy/mirror/site

# Installed and built output (Vercel installs and builds itself)
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Local tooling
.git
.claude
.vercel
